        <div id="r_7064036" class="cell">
        
        <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
            <tr>
                <td width="48" valign="top" align="center"><img src="https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/710c/ecdc/59282_normal.png?m=1781508588" class="avatar" border="0" align="default" alt="Tedko" data-uid="59282" /></td>
                <td width="10" valign="top"></td>
                <td width="auto" valign="top" align="left"><div class="fr"> &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class="no">15</span></div>
                    <div class="sep3"></div>
                    <strong><a href="/member/Tedko" class="dark">Tedko</a></strong> &nbsp; <div class="badges"><div class="badge op">OP</div></div>&nbsp; &nbsp;<span class="ago" title="2019-03-22 10:49:12 +08:00">Mar 22, 2019</span> 
                    <div class="sep5"></div>
                    <div class="reply_content">@<a href="/member/hellojay">hellojay</a> 对。我的意思是我们逐渐会没有中心化服务器的，这样就没有法律问题了（ you know ）</div>
